  "content": [
    {
      "text": "God divided the light from the darkness, Gen. 1:4 (Moses 2:18; Abr. 4:17). in his days was the earth divided, Gen. 10:25 (1 Chr. 1:19; D&C 133:24). thine hand over the sea, and divide it, Ex. 14:16. veil shall divide unto you, Ex. 26:33. divide the land by lot for an inheritance, Num. 33:54 (Ezek. 47:22). divided unto you by lot these nations, Josh. 23:4. Divide the living child in two, 1 Kgs. 3:25. thou didst divide the sea before them, Neh. 9:11. divided the sea, and caused them to pass through, Ps. 78:13. To him which divided the Red sea into parts, Ps. 136:13. he shall divide the spoil with the strong, Isa. 53:12 (Mosiah 14:12). Moses … dividing the water, Isa. 63:12 (1 Ne. 4:2). be divided into two kingdoms, Ezek. 37:22. Their heart is divided, Hosea 10:2.",
